# tally 2.1.8 P46, L §5.10 R14 (G1 of group 3's fix review, agent/p5_plan): a unitless row stands for every unit the
# place holds at its instant, decided from the cut's walk up to that instant, alike for every reader: the plan pay,
# booked at 2026-03-05, reads last(stated[broker], d_q) as RUN-DOMAIN ... in EUR and PLN at its booking cut and at
# K. 61f8630b gave ENGINE-INVARIANT (inside its walk the read took the stated units alone).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
kind wallets: place any signed
place broker: wallets lives 2025-01-01..
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input d_p: date
input x1: money PLN
input x2: money PLN
input d_q: date
def lb: money EUR = last(stated[broker], d_q)
def amt: money PLN = if lb > 0 EUR then x1 else x2
move pay: transfers
  on d_p
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  anchor broker
  d_p = 2026-03-05 "s"
  x1 = 1.00 PLN "s"
  x2 = 2.00 PLN "s"
  d_q = 2026-02-16 "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[broker] = 1.00 EUR at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[broker] = 2.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[broker] = 4.00 EUR at 2026-02-15 end "s"


version v2
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-03-01
  anchor broker
  stated[broker] = ?"not read" at 2026-02-15 end "s"

ask k: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
=== expect
k: refused: RUN-DOMAIN last of broker: its readings at 2026-02-15 end are in EUR and PLN
  cut 2026-06-10
